{"page":703,"blocks":[{"x":0.75517,"y":0.05257,"w":0.19635,"h":0.01535,"fs":0.01535,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"11.6 Conic Sections 689"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.09343,"w":0.59302,"h":0.02882,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"We shift conics using the principles reviewed in Section 1.2, replacing x by x + h and y by y + k."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.14267,"w":0.59302,"h":0.03329,"fs":0.01407,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"EXAMPLE 4 Show that the equation x2 - 4y2 + 2x + 8y - 7 = 0 represents a hyperbola. Find its center, asymptotes, and foci."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.18917,"w":0.58898,"h":0.02899,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"Solution We reduce the equation to standard form by completing the square in x and y as follows:"},{"x":0.58915,"y":0.22324,"w":0.20206,"h":0.01795,"fs":0.01401,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"(x2 + 2x) - 4( y2 - 2y) = 7"},{"x":0.49139,"y":0.25009,"w":0.33215,"h":0.01795,"fs":0.01401,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"(x2 + 2x + 1) - 4( y2 - 2y + 1) = 7 + 1 - 4"},{"x":0.61596,"y":0.27904,"w":0.0562,"h":0.01421,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"(x + 1)2"},{"x":0.63997,"y":0.28462,"w":0.1515,"h":0.02515,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"4 - (y - 1)2 = 1."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.31979,"w":0.59291,"h":0.04417,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"This is the standard form Equation (10) of a hyperbola with x replaced by x + 1 and y replaced by y - 1. The hyperbola is shifted one unit to the left and one unit upward, and it has center x + 1 = 0 and y - 1 = 0, or x = -1 and y = 1. Moreover,"},{"x":0.51164,"y":0.37287,"w":0.29083,"h":0.01795,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"a2 = 4, b2 = 1, c2 = a2 + b2 = 5,"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.40489,"w":0.22793,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"so the asymptotes are the two lines"},{"x":0.46176,"y":0.4277,"w":0.03977,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"x + 1"},{"x":0.47755,"y":0.4277,"w":0.26155,"h":0.02787,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"k":0,"t":"2 - (y - 1) = 0 and x + 1"},{"x":0.71511,"y":0.4349,"w":0.13774,"h":0.02068,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"2 + (y - 1) = 0,"},{"x":0.36259,"y":0.46627,"w":0.01363,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"or"},{"x":0.58326,"y":0.49249,"w":0.08924,"h":0.01982,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"y - 1 = {1"},{"x":0.66432,"y":0.49884,"w":0.06706,"h":0.02068,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"2 (x + 1)."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.52077,"w":0.32869,"h":0.02863,"fs":0.01441,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"The shifted foci have coordinates 1-1 { 25, 12."},{"x":0.08569,"y":0.60478,"w":0.17484,"h":0.02814,"fs":0.02814,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"Exercises 11.6"},{"x":0.53926,"y":0.64116,"w":0.41226,"h":0.01151,"fs":0.01151,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Match each conic section in Exercises 5–8 with one of these equations:"},{"x":0.08775,"y":0.64329,"w":0.39707,"h":0.02609,"fs":0.01151,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"Identifying Graphs Match the parabolas in Exercises 1–4 with the following equations:"},{"x":0.65082,"y":0.66289,"w":0.04349,"h":0.02846,"fs":0.01151,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"4 + y2"},{"x":0.64854,"y":0.6651,"w":0.01187,"h":0.01277,"fs":0.01151,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"x2"},{"x":0.68476,"y":0.6651,"w":0.08362,"h":0.02625,"fs":0.01151,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"9 = 1, x2"},{"x":0.75879,"y":0.66849,"w":0.08005,"h":0.02286,"fs":0.01151,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"2 + y2 = 1,"},{"x":0.15955,"y":0.67497,"w":0.26909,"h":0.01615,"fs":0.01151,"n":4,"k":0,"t":"x2 = 2y, x2 = -6y, y2 = 8x, y2 = -4x."},{"x":0.64854,"y":0.70126,"w":0.01179,"h":0.01277,"fs":0.01151,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"y2"},{"x":0.75864,"y":0.70126,"w":0.04349,"h":0.02846,"fs":0.01151,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"4 - y2"},{"x":0.08775,"y":0.70136,"w":0.27107,"h":0.01151,"fs":0.01151,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Then find each parabola’s focus and directrix."},{"x":0.65078,"y":0.70347,"w":0.11745,"h":0.02625,"fs":0.01151,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"4 - x2 = 1, x2"},{"x":0.79258,"y":0.71088,"w":0.04259,"h":0.01883,"fs":0.01151,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"9 = 1."},{"x":0.09511,"y":0.71924,"w":0.01104,"h":0.01151,"fs":0.01151,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"1."},{"x":0.13199,"y":0.71924,"w":0.17538,"h":0.01151,"fs":0.01151,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"y 2."},{"x":0.53927,"y":0.77416,"w":0.41586,"h":0.02558,"fs":0.01151,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"Then find the conic section’s foci and vertices. If the conic section is a hyperbola, find its asymptotes as well."},{"x":0.61181,"y":0.80563,"w":0.14708,"h":0.012,"fs":0.01151,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"y 6."},{"x":0.54663,"y":0.80611,"w":0.01104,"h":0.01151,"fs":0.01151,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"5."},{"x":0.09511,"y":0.8369,"w":0.01104,"h":0.01151,"fs":0.01151,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"3."},{"x":0.16716,"y":0.8369,"w":0.14021,"h":0.01212,"fs":0.01151,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"y 4."}]}